00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:58.040 line:100%
The Shu road is steep,

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:00.280 line:100%
harder than climbing green mountains.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.400 line:100%
Cut it out.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:02.640 line:100%
You're reading it wrong.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:09.800 line:100%
You scared me to death.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.560 line:100%
I thought my mom suddenly came back.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.200 line:100%
Officer Ran, what is it?

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.160 line:100%
<i>GAOKAO SECRETS</i>
HIGH SCHOOL CHINESE FULL REVIEW GUIDE

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.640 line:100%
Du Mingliang.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.920 line:100%
Someone saw you hanging
around the building all day,

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:22.960 line:100%
acting suspicious.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.080 line:100%
They think you've been
stealing women's underwear,

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:27.360 line:100%
stockings, and high heels.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.640 line:100%
Who's spreading that nonsense?

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.920 line:100%
Officer Ran, I'm not some fetishist.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.360 line:100%
My mom's going through menopause.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.880 line:100%
She keeps nagging me about gaming,

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.480 line:100%
so now I spend my days

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:37.720 line:100%
playing cat and mouse
with her in the hallway.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.440 line:100%
Do you remember?

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:41.840 line:100%
Back then, you even mistook me
for a Pattia hostess.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.720 line:100%
I swear on everything I own,

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:55.160 line:100%
I'm absolutely not a pervert.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.160 line:100%
Then who do you think it is?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.320 line:100%
Du Mingliang.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.280 line:100%
Du Mingliang. You've got some nerve.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.200 line:100%
You played games until you ranked
dead last in school,

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:18.319 line:100%
and now you've even brought
the police right to the door.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.800 line:100%
You really think
I won't beat you senseless?

00:04:19.879 --> 00:04:20.560 line:100%
-Please…
-Beat you senseless?

00:04:20.639 --> 00:04:22.800 line:100%
-Mrs. Du, it's a misunderstanding.
-Officer Ran,

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:25.920 line:100%
did he do something wrong?

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.720 line:100%
It's a misunderstanding.
I'm just here to ask Du a few questions.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.080 line:100%
About what?

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:37.600 line:100%
It's about…

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.440 line:100%
The severed head case?

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.640 line:100%
Let me tell you,

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:48.960 line:100%
years ago,

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.360 line:100%
I did see Xu Zhihong.

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:52.600 line:100%
When?

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.600 line:100%
It should've been

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:57.120 line:100%
before the Hong Kong handover.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:01.080 line:100%
Back then, Xu Zhihong ran to 1713,

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.880 line:100%
Qihuang Clinic,
to argue with Zhang Ersong.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:06.800 line:100%
I just happened to pass by and heard

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.040 line:100%
him shouting inside
about exposing something.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:14.080 line:100%
This Zhang Ersong

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.760 line:100%
is Master Zhang from Qihuang Clinic.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.480 line:100%
What Master Zhang?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.640 line:100%
He's nothing but a con artist
who's done time.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.000 line:100%
I'm from Langzhong, same as him.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.800 line:100%
So Qihuang Clinic was shut down

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.640 line:100%
because Xu Zhihong exposed him?

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.560 line:100%
Shut down? Not at all.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.080 line:100%
They just moved
to a bigger place to expand.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:33.160 line:100%
Now it's a large clinic.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.720 line:100%
What's it called?

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.200 line:100%
Songbentang.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.760 line:100%
I've lived here for over 20 years.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:46.400 line:100%
Back when Xu's mother was still alive,
we had some contact.

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.520 line:100%
Ever since Xu died in a mountain accident,

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:50.680 line:100%
he started borrowing money everywhere.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.320 line:100%
I didn't dare keep in touch
with them anymore.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.200 line:100%
Can you think back again,

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.440 line:100%
before the 1997 handover of Hong Kong,

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:00.480 line:100%
did anything unusual
happen in the Xu family?

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:02.800 line:100%
Unusual?

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.680 line:100%
Unusual…

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:08.320 line:100%
Yes, there was something unusual.

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:12.640 line:100%
It was a few days
before Hong Kong's handover.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.280 line:20%
POWER OUTAGE NOTICE

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:45.400 line:100%
What's wrong, Uncle Wang?

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.320 line:100%
Xu,

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.480 line:100%
why is your place
making that banging noise?

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.640 line:100%
My dad wants to sell the big wardrobe.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.920 line:100%
The doorway's too narrow.
Can't get it out.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.000 line:100%
So I thought I'd chisel
the doorframe a bit.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.160 line:100%
Why sell it?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:05.080 line:100%
There's a qigong master in Yuanlongli

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:06.680 line:100%
who claims he can cure anything.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.040 line:100%
He's just expensive.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.440 line:100%
Oh…

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:11.840 line:100%
Uncle Wang,

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.560 line:100%
you…

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.920 line:100%
I've got mung bean soup cooking at home.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.120 line:100%
It's going to burn.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.320 line:100%
It's going to burn.

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:20.400 line:100%
It's burning…

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.600 line:100%
30TH MONDAY

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:39.000 line:100%
That wardrobe was still inside, not sold.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.000 line:100%
The scrap collector came the next day

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:44.480 line:100%
and haggled with Xu for a long time.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.280 line:100%
In the end, they didn't
reach a deal on the wardrobe,

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.840 line:100%
so he just took away
a bunch of jars and bottles.

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:55.960 line:100%
How about this?

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:59.000 line:100%
Call the person who hired you

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:02.720 line:100%
and tell him the 500 is up.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.120 line:100%
Ask him to send you more.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:07.560 line:100%
Do you have the number?

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.000 line:100%
Let me check.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.080 line:100%
Still here.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:15.720 line:100%
This one.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.400 line:100%
A Guangdong number?

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.200 line:100%
I haven't called it in years.

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:30.160 line:100%
<i>Hello. The number you have dialed</i>
<i>is no longer in service.</i>

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.440 line:100%
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.440 line:100%
<i>Sorry, the subscriber you dialed…</i>

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.200 line:100%
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:40.240 line:100%
<i>Hello. The number you have dialed</i>
<i>is no longer in service.</i>

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.000 line:100%
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.760 line:100%
<i>Hello. The number you have dialed</i>
<i>is no longer in service.</i>

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.680 line:100%
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.840 line:100%
How did it become a dead number?

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:02.400 line:100%
Even this last bit of hope is gone.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.040 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:10.720 line:100%
<i>Freedom, freedom</i>

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:14.520 line:100%
<i>Close your eyes</i>
<i>And get a good night's sleep</i>

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:17.560 line:100%
<i>Run, run</i>
<i>Leave the past behind</i>

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:21.000 line:100%
<i>No matter the outcome, it doesn't matter</i>

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:27.800 line:100%
Why did it stop?

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:46.920 line:100%
Who let you sneak the instruments out?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:49.960 line:100%
Dad,

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.080 line:100%
we just borrowed them for a bit.

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:53.800 line:100%
We'll take good care of them.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:54.560 line:100%
SLOW

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:55.640 line:100%
Nothing will get damaged.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.320 line:100%
What did I tell you?

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.280 line:100%
If you want to start a band,

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.360 line:100%
bring me a university
admission letter in exchange.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:03.120 line:100%
Did you take that as nothing?

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:05.120 line:100%
Move everything back!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.200 line:100%
I'll deal with you when you get home.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.360 line:100%
Uncle.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.200 line:100%
We've written a new song.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:21.960 line:100%
Do you want to hear it?

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.280 line:100%
Maybe after you listen,

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.520 line:100%
you'll support our rock dream.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.760 line:100%
Rock dream?

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.240 line:100%
Is that something
students should be doing?

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:39.880 line:100%
Look at you all,

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:42.600 line:100%
one worse than the next,
acting like hooligans.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:44.280 line:100%
Instead of studying properly at home,

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:45.480 line:100%
you mess around all day.

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:46.720 line:100%
What future will you have?

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:50.240 line:100%
Are you moving it or not?

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:55.600 line:100%
Not moving it, right?

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.040 line:100%
Dad.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.520 line:100%
-Let go.
-Don't grab it.

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:01.360 line:100%
-Let go.
-Don't grab it.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.000 line:100%
Keyboard!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:13.880 line:20%
PUBLIC SECURITY

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:16.320 line:20%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.120 line:20%
Captain, before Han Zi'ang
injured someone,

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.120 line:100%
he was very likely attacked.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:24.680 line:100%
Explain. How did you come
to that conclusion?

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:27.160 line:100%
When I went to Yuanlongli to investigate,

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.200 line:100%
I ran into my dad.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:30.720 line:100%
He and Ran

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.920 line:100%
once carried out an immersive reenactment.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.080 line:100%
I know my dad wasn't in the clearest
state of mind back then,

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:43.760 line:100%
but I believe Captain Ran's theory
is sound.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.200 line:100%
The Han Zi'ang case

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.360 line:100%
is definitely more than just a prank.

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.040 line:100%
MODERN LAW ENFORCEMENT
UNWAVERING POLICE EXCELLENCE

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:54.680 line:100%
Yesterday, I also
made a pledge to the principal.

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:55.720 line:100%
Within a week,

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.640 line:100%
I'll prove that Han Zi'ang acted
in self defense.

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:01.280 line:100%
Otherwise, he'll be expelled.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:04.920 line:100%
Captain, can you assign me more manpower?

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.680 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:14.800 line:100%
I understand how you feel.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.000 line:100%
You want to find the truth

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.560 line:100%
and help Han Zi'ang.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.680 line:100%
But the situation in the unit,
you should know it too.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.800 line:100%
Those four kids still haven't been found.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:25.480 line:100%
Everyone… Right now, everyone
is tied up with the task force.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.360 line:100%
You're relying on Mr. He and Ran…

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.960 line:100%
Just on a few of Mr. He's deductions,

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.080 line:100%
with no evidence, no leads.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.560 line:100%
Then tell me,

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:36.200 line:100%
how am I supposed to ask
the task force for people?

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:56.640 line:100%
FREE REFILLS, HELP YOURSELF

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.200 line:100%
Why the long face?

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.760 line:100%
Is the cafeteria food that bad?

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:12.320 line:100%
It's not bad,

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:13.600 line:100%
it just feels awful.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:17.480 line:100%
The Han Zi'ang case?

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.320 line:100%
I don't have a single lead right now.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.560 line:100%
And my dad keeps making things worse.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:26.640 line:100%
This is my first case.

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.200 line:100%
If only Uncle Ran were here,

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:31.920 line:100%
he'd never let me turn in a blank.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.960 line:100%
In the whole Nanshan Branch,

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.840 line:100%
people who say that
could line up to the gate.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.840 line:100%
When you handle cases,
if all you do is rely on Captain Ran,

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:42.760 line:100%
then do you know,

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.680 line:100%
back then, Captain Ran
also had someone he relied on?

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:45.800 line:100%
Who?

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:47.880 line:100%
Someone even more impressive
than Uncle Ran?

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:51.000 line:100%
One time after working late,
I went for a late-night snack

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:53.160 line:100%
and ran into your Uncle Ran
at the entrance.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.160 line:100%
He seemed troubled.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.320 line:100%
That was the first time I saw him drink.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.240 line:100%
He told me

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.040 line:100%
the person he respected most
from the bottom of his heart

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:06.920 line:100%
was your dad.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.320 line:100%
He also said, if not for your dad,

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.840 line:100%
he wouldn't have made it
this far so smoothly.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.960 line:100%
He might not have even gotten through
his very first case.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.400 line:100%
When did that happen?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.480 line:100%
Around 2002, I think.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.200 line:100%
Time flies.

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:32.120 line:100%
It's been 12 years
since Captain Ran passed.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.440 line:100%
If you want to look
into Han Zi'ang's case,

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:41.560 line:100%
you'd better ask
the experts from Yuanlongli.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.640 line:100%
There are two experts in the unit.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:45.760 line:100%
One was Captain Ran back then,

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.000 line:100%
and the other is your dad.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:31.600 line:20%
NOTEBOOK

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:38.520 line:100%
SITUATION AT THE 18TH FLOOR

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:56.360 line:100%
FLOOR PLAN OF YUANLONGLI
UNDERGROUND PARKING GARAGE

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:02.640 line:100%
How did I forget
about the underground garage?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.520 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:27.120 line:20%
CLOSED

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.080 line:100%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:49.680 line:100%
Miss, take a look,
we've got new flowers in.

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:52.000 line:100%
-No thanks. Thank you.
-It's alright.

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:03.080 line:100%
Hello. Have you seen this child before?

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.800 line:100%
-No, I haven't.
-Thank you.

00:17:06.879 --> 00:17:08.399 line:100%
Sir, hello.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:10.560 line:100%
Have you seen this child before?

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:13.639 line:100%
BARBECUE AND BAR

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.560 line:100%
Hello. Have you seen this child before?

00:17:16.639 --> 00:17:17.399 line:100%
Have you seen him?

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:19.520 line:100%
Hello. Have you seen this child before?

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:20.639 line:100%
Have you seen this child?

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:21.800 line:100%
I haven't seen him.

00:17:21.879 --> 00:17:24.200 line:100%
Have you seen this child before?

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:25.560 line:100%
Have you seen him?

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.159 line:100%
Have you seen this child?

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:30.120 line:100%
Hello. Have you seen this child before?

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:31.240 line:100%
No, I haven't.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:33.720 line:100%
Thank you.

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:35.840 line:100%
JUAN JUAN SHOE SHOP

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:42.760 line:100%
FREE NAIL ART AND TATTOO TRAINING

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:50.000 line:100%
The Tremaux method
is the most time consuming

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:52.960 line:100%
among all maze solving methods,
but it has the highest success rate.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:56.480 line:100%
The idea is to walk through every path

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:58.920 line:100%
and mark them to avoid repeating mistakes.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.320 line:100%
LIANGLIANG COMPUTER SUPPLIES

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:02.720 line:100%
Hello, boss.

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:05.040 line:100%
May I ask, how do I get
to the stairway to New York Block?

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:08.120 line:100%
Left, right, right,
left, left, left, right.

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:11.720 line:100%
-Thanks.
-Yeah.

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:16.760 line:100%
Recently, have you seen this student?

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:17.680 line:100%
What for?

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.040 line:100%
Police investigation.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:27.880 line:100%
Haven't seen him.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.160 line:100%
Thanks.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:07.920 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.480 line:100%
why are you sitting here alone?

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:11.800 line:100%
Where is everyone else?

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.160 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:22.960 line:100%
Rehearsal not going well?

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:40.600 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:05.440 line:100%
Did something happen?

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:07.800 line:100%
It's not me. It's the keyboard player.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.600 line:100%
His dad came today,

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:11.720 line:100%
took all the instruments, and beat him up.

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:15.240 line:100%
Why are adults always like this?

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.920 line:100%
Why can't they support our dreams?

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.680 line:100%
Didn't they have dreams
when they were young?

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:28.560 line:100%
Maybe when they chased their dreams,

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:30.200 line:100%
they stumbled too many times,

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.600 line:100%
so they don't want you
to go through the same thing.

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:35.320 line:100%
Whether his dad has dreams, I don't know,

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.360 line:100%
but my dad definitely doesn't have any.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.640 line:100%
Otherwise, my mom wouldn't
have gotten so mad, she left home.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:57.960 line:100%
BANK

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.840 line:100%
CONTACT: YUN, MAKE A CALL?

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.120 line:100%
CONTACT: YUN

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:41.040 line:100%
CALLING YUN

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:41.960 line:100%
END CALL

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:35.080 line:100%
-What are you doing?
-Noise. Disturbing the peace.

00:22:35.680 --> 00:22:37.560 line:100%
Leave my room immediately.

00:22:37.640 --> 00:22:38.680 line:100%
He.

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:46.960 line:100%
Look at her,
acting completely out of control.

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:48.520 line:100%
Take it easy.

00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:50.160 line:100%
Leave it to me.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:18.560 line:100%
How did you do that?
What did you say to her?

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:20.920 line:100%
Nothing much.
Just gave her a pair of headphones.

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:24.800 line:100%
Eat first.

00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:26.840 line:100%
There's more in the pot
if it's not enough.

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:34.880 line:100%
Let's talk business.
I'll brief you on the case.

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:37.240 line:100%
The Forensic Department

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:40.200 line:100%
found signs of arsenic poisoning
in Xu Zhihong's skull.

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:42.680 line:100%
At the Xu residence,

00:23:42.760 --> 00:23:44.280 line:100%
I found some herbal residue.

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:46.240 line:100%
I've already handed it over to Liang Juan.

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:49.240 line:100%
The test report should be out tomorrow.

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:52.000 line:100%
Zhang…

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:56.320 line:100%
Zhang Ersong.

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:57.360 line:100%
Who?

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:02.080 line:100%
Master Zhang from 1713 Qihuang Clinic.

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:04.560 line:100%
This should be the prescription
he gave Xu Zhihong.

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:06.560 line:100%
I found out Xu Zhihong
once had a huge argument

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:07.600 line:100%
with Zhang Ersong.

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:08.880 line:100%
He even threatened to expose him.

00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:11.080 line:100%
The two fell out badly.

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:12.600 line:100%
Zhang Ersong

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:14.400 line:100%
deliberately poisoned him?

00:24:21.040 --> 00:24:24.360 line:100%
<i>The skin of mung beans is green.</i>
<i>It belongs to wood.</i>

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:25.120 line:20%
QIGONG MASTER, ZHANG ERSONG

00:24:25.640 --> 00:24:28.760 line:100%
<i>When boiled into soup, it turns yellow,</i>
<i>which belongs to earth.</i>

00:24:28.840 --> 00:24:30.440 line:100%
<i>This spirited,</i>

00:24:30.520 --> 00:24:32.480 line:100%
<i>energetic elderly gentleman</i>

00:24:32.560 --> 00:24:34.400 line:20%
<i>is the renowned healer of Beijing,</i>

00:24:34.480 --> 00:24:35.920 line:20%
<i>a third generation inheritor,</i>

00:24:36.000 --> 00:24:37.880 line:20%
<i>Master Zhang Ersong.</i>

00:24:37.960 --> 00:24:39.840 line:100%
<i>Mung beans and eggplant,</i>

00:24:40.440 --> 00:24:42.200 line:100%
<i>together complete the five elements.</i>

00:24:42.720 --> 00:24:47.000 line:100%
THE MEDICINAL DREGS DELIVERED YESTERDAY
CONTAINED TRACE ARSENIC.

00:24:48.800 --> 00:24:50.600 line:100%
<i>Songbentang Traditional Medicine Clinic</i>

00:24:50.680 --> 00:24:54.240 line:100%
<i>was founded by Master Zhang Ersong,</i>

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:56.520 line:20%
<i>a third generation healer of Beijing.</i>

00:24:57.120 --> 00:24:58.400 line:100%
-<i>Master Zhang Ersong</i>
-Zhang Ersong.

00:24:58.480 --> 00:25:00.400 line:100%
<i>is like Hua Tuo reborn.</i>

00:25:00.480 --> 00:25:01.440 line:100%
What are you here for?

00:25:01.960 --> 00:25:03.640 line:100%
-Registration number?
-What number?

00:25:04.520 --> 00:25:06.320 line:100%
To see Master Zhang, you need to register.

00:25:06.400 --> 00:25:08.040 line:100%
This number should work, right?

00:25:08.120 --> 00:25:09.040 line:100%
I don't care who you are.

00:25:09.120 --> 00:25:11.240 line:100%
Even the mayor has to register.

00:25:11.320 --> 00:25:13.200 line:100%
And Master Zhang is off today,
no consultations.

00:25:16.640 --> 00:25:17.760 line:100%
Zhang Ersong,

00:25:17.840 --> 00:25:19.680 line:100%
a relative from your hometown
in Langzhong is here.

00:25:19.760 --> 00:25:21.680 line:100%
Your home is in Chentang County,

00:25:21.760 --> 00:25:23.760 line:100%
Maquan Township, Wumaganzhi Village.

00:25:23.840 --> 00:25:26.200 line:100%
At 25, you committed fraud
and served time.

00:25:26.280 --> 00:25:27.920 line:100%
-At 28…
-<i>Zhao,</i>

00:25:28.600 --> 00:25:30.400 line:100%
<i>let this patient in.</i>

00:25:30.920 --> 00:25:33.120 line:100%
<i>You can tell at a glance</i>
<i>he's seriously ill.</i>

00:25:33.200 --> 00:25:34.040 line:100%
Alright.

00:25:35.600 --> 00:25:36.920 line:100%
Go on in.

00:25:40.960 --> 00:25:42.240 line:100%
BENEVOLENT HEART, DIVINE HEALING

00:25:42.320 --> 00:25:43.560 line:100%
A MIRACLE HEALER, A BENEVOLENT MASTER

00:25:50.960 --> 00:25:51.960 line:100%
Please have a look, both of you.

00:25:53.240 --> 00:25:54.240 line:100%
WEIYANG PEOPLE'S HOSPITAL
MEDICAL DIAGNOSIS

00:25:54.320 --> 00:25:55.240 line:100%
Officers,

00:25:55.320 --> 00:25:57.320 line:100%
I've truly been wronged.

00:25:57.400 --> 00:26:00.400 line:100%
The prescription I gave Xu Zhihong

00:26:00.480 --> 00:26:02.920 line:100%
was something I developed
through years of research.

00:26:03.000 --> 00:26:05.400 line:100%
Even now that I'm ill,

00:26:05.480 --> 00:26:07.400 line:100%
I'm still using the same prescription.

00:26:10.680 --> 00:26:13.120 line:100%
What exactly is in
this prescription of yours?

00:26:13.720 --> 00:26:16.240 line:100%
That's a trade secret.

00:26:16.760 --> 00:26:18.320 line:100%
A proprietary formula.

00:26:19.120 --> 00:26:22.200 line:100%
You added a large amount
of realgar to this medicine, didn't you?

00:26:22.800 --> 00:26:23.760 line:100%
How do you know?

00:26:25.240 --> 00:26:27.680 line:100%
Realgar contains a high amount of arsenic.

00:26:27.760 --> 00:26:29.240 line:100%
Long term excessive use

00:26:29.320 --> 00:26:31.600 line:100%
can lead to arsenic poisoning.

00:26:32.280 --> 00:26:33.120 line:100%
You…

00:26:33.640 --> 00:26:35.280 line:100%
You're not trying to fool me, are you?

00:26:38.000 --> 00:26:39.840 line:100%
Hospital reports don't lie, do they?

00:26:40.520 --> 00:26:43.480 line:100%
Anyone with basic scientific knowledge
would understand that.

00:26:45.240 --> 00:26:46.760 line:100%
This is the first time I've seen

00:26:46.840 --> 00:26:48.880 line:100%
someone poison others
and not spare himself.

00:26:53.520 --> 00:26:54.480 line:100%
Tell me,

00:26:54.560 --> 00:26:57.320 line:100%
that Xu Zhihong,
why did he want to expose you?

00:26:58.280 --> 00:27:01.040 line:100%
That was due to his frostbite condition.

00:27:01.120 --> 00:27:02.800 line:100%
How would I know?

00:27:02.880 --> 00:27:05.240 line:100%
After Xu Zhihong got the medicine,

00:27:05.320 --> 00:27:06.680 line:100%
he started pestering me,

00:27:06.760 --> 00:27:08.520 line:100%
demanding a refund,

00:27:08.600 --> 00:27:10.360 line:100%
even threatening to go to the media.

00:27:10.440 --> 00:27:12.320 line:100%
You tell me,

00:27:12.400 --> 00:27:14.560 line:100%
how could I not get
into a conflict with him?

00:27:15.960 --> 00:27:17.480 line:100%
A conflict is one thing,

00:27:17.560 --> 00:27:20.400 line:100%
but it wouldn't escalate
to the level of murder.

00:27:22.760 --> 00:27:23.800 line:100%
The key is…

00:27:28.600 --> 00:27:31.400 line:100%
The key is, I already refunded his money.

00:27:33.760 --> 00:27:35.840 line:100%
REFUND RECEIPT

00:27:39.200 --> 00:27:40.880 line:100%
Before you moved out of Yuanlongli,

00:27:40.960 --> 00:27:42.800 line:100%
did you encounter anything unusual?

00:27:42.880 --> 00:27:44.920 line:100%
If you're asking about the case,

00:27:45.000 --> 00:27:46.680 line:100%
I really don't know.

00:27:46.760 --> 00:27:48.960 line:100%
But if you want gossip,

00:27:49.040 --> 00:27:50.680 line:100%
back in those days at Qihuang Clinic,

00:27:50.760 --> 00:27:52.200 line:100%
there was gossip every day.

00:27:52.280 --> 00:27:54.240 line:100%
The property manager, Qian Dajun,

00:27:54.320 --> 00:27:56.240 line:100%
used to moonlight at my place,
reselling appointment slots.

00:27:56.320 --> 00:27:58.280 line:100%
Cripple Du from the steel factory

00:27:58.360 --> 00:28:00.160 line:100%
and Song Qingsong from the cement plant

00:28:00.240 --> 00:28:02.640 line:100%
both came to me for kidney issues.

00:28:03.240 --> 00:28:05.520 line:100%
But Song Qingsong didn't come often.

00:28:05.600 --> 00:28:07.720 line:100%
The membership card he got
was used by his brother-in-law.

00:28:07.800 --> 00:28:09.720 line:100%
And Jin Manshan from Jinsha Market

00:28:09.800 --> 00:28:12.280 line:100%
also came to me for heart treatment.

00:28:15.360 --> 00:28:17.560 line:100%
Back then, someone
came to me to practice qigong,

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:20.720 line:100%
saying he wanted to treat
his strange condition.

00:28:20.800 --> 00:28:21.760 line:100%
A strange condition?

00:28:21.840 --> 00:28:24.320 line:100%
He said he had a peculiar habit.

00:28:25.640 --> 00:28:27.320 line:100%
He couldn't be with women,

00:28:27.400 --> 00:28:29.760 line:100%
yet he liked collecting women's clothing

00:28:30.280 --> 00:28:33.360 line:100%
and watching women's bodies
from a distance.

00:28:39.120 --> 00:28:40.120 line:100%
Who was that person?

00:28:41.000 --> 00:28:42.040 line:100%
I remember now.

00:28:42.120 --> 00:28:44.040 line:100%
Xu Zhihong was introduced by him.

00:28:44.120 --> 00:28:46.120 line:100%
He even said Xu Meng was his god-sister.

00:28:46.880 --> 00:28:49.720 line:100%
You could tell right away
it wasn't a proper relationship.

00:28:49.800 --> 00:28:51.160 line:100%
Who exactly was it?

00:28:51.240 --> 00:28:53.600 line:100%
Didn't I just mention him?

00:28:54.200 --> 00:28:55.600 line:100%
Wu Shanlong.

00:29:07.760 --> 00:29:08.760 line:100%
Hello?

00:29:08.840 --> 00:29:09.840 line:100%
<i>Officer He,</i>

00:29:09.920 --> 00:29:11.640 line:100%
<i>the video rental shop owner</i>
<i>you asked me to find</i>

00:29:11.720 --> 00:29:12.640 line:100%
<i>has been arrested at the station.</i>

00:29:17.200 --> 00:29:20.480 line:20%
PUBLIC SECURITY

00:29:27.440 --> 00:29:28.520 line:100%
I'd like to ask,

00:29:28.600 --> 00:29:30.800 line:100%
for producing obscene discs,

00:29:30.880 --> 00:29:32.320 line:100%
how long would I be sentenced?

00:29:32.920 --> 00:29:35.440 line:100%
If I provide clues
about the severed head case,

00:29:36.200 --> 00:29:37.920 line:100%
would that count as meritorious service?

00:29:40.880 --> 00:29:42.240 line:100%
Wu Zhengxiong.

00:29:42.320 --> 00:29:43.400 line:100%
Whether it counts as meritorious service

00:29:43.480 --> 00:29:44.920 line:100%
depends on whether
the information you provide

00:29:45.000 --> 00:29:45.960 line:100%
is actually useful.

00:29:46.040 --> 00:29:47.640 line:100%
It'll definitely be useful.

00:29:48.280 --> 00:29:49.440 line:100%
Back in '97,

00:29:49.520 --> 00:29:50.920 line:100%
someone came to the video rental shop

00:29:51.000 --> 00:29:52.720 line:100%
to hire Wolfie to kill someone.

00:29:52.800 --> 00:29:54.440 line:100%
I took note of that person back then.

00:29:55.720 --> 00:29:56.680 line:100%
Why didn't you report it at the time?

00:29:56.760 --> 00:29:57.800 line:100%
Officer,

00:29:58.320 --> 00:29:59.800 line:100%
I'm just an ordinary citizen.

00:30:00.520 --> 00:30:02.680 line:100%
How would I dare
offend people from that world?

00:30:02.760 --> 00:30:05.400 line:100%
Besides, I don't have nine lives.

00:30:05.480 --> 00:30:07.080 line:100%
Cut the nonsense.

00:30:07.160 --> 00:30:08.440 line:100%
Who was that person?

00:30:09.880 --> 00:30:12.200 line:100%
Song Qingsong's brother-in-law,
Wu Shanlong.

00:30:12.280 --> 00:30:14.520 line:100%
I saw him clearly back then.

00:30:14.600 --> 00:30:15.760 line:100%
He was even driving that Mercedes

00:30:15.840 --> 00:30:17.840 line:100%
with the license ending in 688.

00:30:18.800 --> 00:30:20.640 line:100%
-Are you sure?
-I'm sure.

00:30:20.720 --> 00:30:23.000 line:100%
Officer, I'm very good
at remembering faces.

00:30:23.080 --> 00:30:25.880 line:100%
Back then, Jin Manshan
and his subordinate, Hu Anping,

00:30:25.960 --> 00:30:28.640 line:100%
even took me to the entrance of Dahuihuang
to identify him in person.

00:30:31.880 --> 00:30:33.000 line:100%
Officer,

00:30:33.520 --> 00:30:35.200 line:100%
I've told you almost everything.

00:30:35.280 --> 00:30:36.800 line:100%
About my case…

00:30:36.880 --> 00:30:38.840 line:100%
-In this case…
-Han.

00:30:39.800 --> 00:30:41.800 line:100%
-What is it, Officer He?
-Your turn.

00:30:41.880 --> 00:30:42.840 line:100%
Alright.

00:30:42.920 --> 00:30:45.960 line:100%
Officer, does this count
as meritorious service?

00:30:46.040 --> 00:30:47.800 line:100%
-Officer.
-Sit down.

00:30:51.160 --> 00:30:52.840 line:100%
He, let's go to Hongyun Huihuang Club.

00:30:52.920 --> 00:30:53.800 line:100%
Let's go.

00:30:54.320 --> 00:30:55.280 line:100%
Hold on.

00:30:58.440 --> 00:31:00.560 line:100%
-What were those words?
-What does that mean?

00:31:01.600 --> 00:31:02.920 line:100%
You take the lead, I'll back you up.

00:31:03.000 --> 00:31:05.280 line:100%
You go upfront, I stay behind.
You play it clean, I handle the rough.

00:31:07.280 --> 00:31:08.800 line:100%
What kind of coordination is that?

00:31:08.880 --> 00:31:10.040 line:100%
Catching him is what matters.

00:31:10.120 --> 00:31:11.080 line:100%
Let's go.

00:31:11.160 --> 00:31:13.120 line:100%
I really can't believe this.

00:31:13.720 --> 00:31:15.200 line:100%
In broad daylight,

00:31:15.280 --> 00:31:18.880 line:100%
someone actually dares
to assault a law abiding citizen.

00:31:18.960 --> 00:31:20.360 line:100%
And you're still sitting there?

00:31:20.440 --> 00:31:21.880 line:100%
How are you enforcing the law?

00:31:21.960 --> 00:31:23.000 line:100%
Why are you just sitting there?

00:31:23.080 --> 00:31:24.880 line:100%
Go catch him.

00:31:25.400 --> 00:31:27.360 line:100%
Do you have no sense of compassion at all?

00:31:27.440 --> 00:31:29.400 line:100%
Look at this. You won't
even pour me a cup of tea.

00:31:29.480 --> 00:31:31.600 line:100%
Is this how you treat an injured person?

00:31:34.120 --> 00:31:35.560 line:100%
I came here to report a case,

00:31:36.320 --> 00:31:39.800 line:100%
so why does it feel like
I'm the one being interrogated?

00:31:42.080 --> 00:31:44.640 line:100%
You two officers,
aren't you criminal police?

00:31:44.720 --> 00:31:46.520 line:100%
Why are you working at the station?

00:31:46.600 --> 00:31:47.440 line:100%
Wu Shanlong,

00:31:47.520 --> 00:31:49.280 line:100%
you should know very well

00:31:49.360 --> 00:31:50.800 line:100%
why we're here.

00:31:51.600 --> 00:31:53.000 line:100%
I don't know. How would I know?

00:31:53.080 --> 00:31:54.360 line:100%
You don't know?

00:31:54.440 --> 00:31:55.480 line:100%
Fine.

00:31:55.560 --> 00:31:57.240 line:100%
Start by explaining
what happened to your head.

00:31:58.520 --> 00:32:00.280 line:100%
Someone tried to harm me.

00:32:00.360 --> 00:32:01.360 line:100%
In broad daylight,

00:32:01.440 --> 00:32:03.680 line:100%
he tried to smash my head open.

00:32:05.680 --> 00:32:07.840 line:100%
Who tried to harm you? Tell it in detail.

00:32:07.920 --> 00:32:09.400 line:100%
After we met yesterday,

00:32:09.480 --> 00:32:11.080 line:100%
I was about to drive home.

00:32:11.160 --> 00:32:14.160 line:100%
I don't know who put
a stone under my tire.

00:32:14.240 --> 00:32:15.720 line:100%
So I got out, and when
I was moving that stone,

00:32:15.800 --> 00:32:17.960 line:100%
suddenly, someone appeared behind me,

00:32:18.040 --> 00:32:19.240 line:100%
and then bang,

00:32:21.160 --> 00:32:22.560 line:100%
hit the back of my head.

00:32:22.640 --> 00:32:24.240 line:100%
Luckily, I've trained
in martial arts before.

00:32:24.320 --> 00:32:25.160 line:100%
My reflexes were fast.

00:32:25.240 --> 00:32:28.440 line:100%
Otherwise, my head
would've been split in two.

00:32:28.520 --> 00:32:30.000 line:100%
Was there anyone else at the scene?

00:32:31.760 --> 00:32:32.920 line:100%
I left through the back door.

00:32:33.640 --> 00:32:34.920 line:100%
No one saw anything.

00:32:38.240 --> 00:32:39.840 line:100%
This is the weapon
the attacker left behind.

00:32:39.920 --> 00:32:41.160 line:100%
Take it and run tests.

00:32:41.240 --> 00:32:43.400 line:100%
The attacker's fingerprints must be on it.

00:32:44.000 --> 00:32:46.040 line:100%
Right now, it's all
your fingerprints on it.

00:32:53.480 --> 00:32:55.400 line:100%
Who do you think attacked you?

00:32:55.920 --> 00:32:57.160 line:100%
I don't know who it was.

00:32:57.240 --> 00:32:58.520 line:100%
Maybe someone saw
I was driving a Mercedes,

00:32:58.600 --> 00:33:01.240 line:100%
thought I had money, and tried to rob me.

00:33:01.320 --> 00:33:04.240 line:100%
After knocking me out,
they realized I was broke.

00:33:07.480 --> 00:33:08.840 line:100%
Don't worry,

00:33:08.920 --> 00:33:10.640 line:100%
we'll take this seriously.

00:33:10.720 --> 00:33:12.520 line:100%
Do you have anything else to add?

00:33:15.800 --> 00:33:17.000 line:100%
No.

00:33:23.760 --> 00:33:25.480 line:100%
Then that's all.

00:33:25.560 --> 00:33:26.800 line:100%
I can leave now, right?

00:33:26.880 --> 00:33:29.320 line:100%
Who said you could leave?
We still have more questions.

00:33:29.400 --> 00:33:32.320 line:100%
Repeat what you said yesterday
at Hongyun Huihuang Club.

00:33:32.400 --> 00:33:33.880 line:100%
Didn't I already say it yesterday?

00:33:33.960 --> 00:33:35.560 line:100%
-It's only been a day…
-Cut the nonsense.

00:33:35.640 --> 00:33:36.800 line:100%
Say it.

00:33:40.240 --> 00:33:42.640 line:100%
A few years ago,
Song Qingsong gave me 40,000

00:33:42.720 --> 00:33:44.440 line:100%
to get rid of Xu Meng and her father.

00:33:44.520 --> 00:33:46.880 line:100%
He may not know the law, but I do.
I couldn't possibly do what he asked…

00:33:46.960 --> 00:33:48.760 line:100%
What you said doesn't match
your earlier statement.

00:33:53.080 --> 00:33:53.960 line:100%
It's the same.

00:33:54.040 --> 00:33:55.360 line:100%
There's no difference. It's the same.

00:33:56.240 --> 00:33:58.040 line:100%
Song Qingsong, 40,000,

00:33:58.120 --> 00:33:59.760 line:100%
Xu Meng and her father. I didn't do it.

00:33:59.840 --> 00:34:00.960 line:100%
Then…

00:34:01.720 --> 00:34:03.040 line:100%
Wu Shanlong,

00:34:03.560 --> 00:34:07.120 line:100%
someone reported that you hired Wolfie
to kill Xu Meng and her father.

00:34:07.720 --> 00:34:09.240 line:100%
Who said that? Who said it?

00:34:09.320 --> 00:34:10.360 line:100%
That's slander.

00:34:10.439 --> 00:34:11.200 line:100%
A false accusation.
This is clearly a frame up…

00:34:11.280 --> 00:34:12.600 line:100%
Wu Shanlong.

00:34:13.280 --> 00:34:15.640 line:100%
According to the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

00:34:15.720 --> 00:34:17.320 line:100%
Articles 25 and 29,

00:34:17.400 --> 00:34:19.400 line:100%
hiring someone to kill is punished

00:34:19.479 --> 00:34:21.200 line:100%
as joint intentional homicide.

00:34:21.280 --> 00:34:23.479 line:100%
The person who hires
is considered an instigator

00:34:23.560 --> 00:34:25.240 line:100%
and bears primary criminal responsibility.

00:34:25.320 --> 00:34:27.519 line:100%
That's impossible.
Someone must be framing me.

00:34:27.600 --> 00:34:29.080 line:100%
-Impossible.
-Think carefully.

00:34:29.600 --> 00:34:32.200 line:100%
Will you confess for leniency
or resist and face harsher punishment?

00:34:40.080 --> 00:34:40.959 line:100%
Confess.

00:34:41.959 --> 00:34:43.120 line:100%
I'll confess.

00:34:44.160 --> 00:34:45.880 line:100%
I did hire Wolfie.

00:34:45.959 --> 00:34:47.680 line:100%
Song Qingsong instructed

00:34:47.760 --> 00:34:50.080 line:100%
that Xu Meng and her father
be driven out of Weiyang.

00:34:50.160 --> 00:34:51.999 line:100%
I only meant to scare them away.

00:34:52.080 --> 00:34:53.760 line:100%
I never intended to kill anyone.

00:34:53.840 --> 00:34:56.080 line:100%
Besides, Wolfie never acted.

00:34:56.160 --> 00:34:57.680 line:100%
-So…
-If Wolfie didn't act,

00:34:57.760 --> 00:34:59.320 line:100%
then how did Xu Meng and her father die?

00:34:59.400 --> 00:35:01.400 line:100%
-Did you hire someone else?
-No.

00:35:01.480 --> 00:35:03.440 line:100%
-Or did you do it yourself?
-How could that be?

00:35:03.520 --> 00:35:05.400 line:100%
It has nothing to do with me.
I didn't do anything.

00:35:06.400 --> 00:35:07.880 line:100%
Stop playing tricks.

00:35:10.000 --> 00:35:11.440 line:100%
I don't know anything anymore.

00:35:11.520 --> 00:35:13.600 line:100%
I don't know anything now.
Go ask Song Qingsong.

00:35:13.680 --> 00:35:14.720 line:100%
I don't know anything. Ask Song Qingsong.

00:35:14.800 --> 00:35:16.040 line:100%
I want to go home now.

00:35:18.960 --> 00:35:20.720 line:100%
Playing dumb,

00:35:20.800 --> 00:35:22.240 line:100%
digging in his heels.

00:35:22.760 --> 00:35:25.400 line:100%
He's definitely still hiding something.

00:35:25.480 --> 00:35:27.520 line:100%
Since Wu Zhengxiong has pointed to him,

00:35:27.600 --> 00:35:30.160 line:100%
then let's just detain him for 48 hours,

00:35:30.240 --> 00:35:32.200 line:100%
wear him down, then press him again.

00:35:32.280 --> 00:35:33.560 line:100%
He,

00:35:33.640 --> 00:35:36.200 line:100%
Wu Shanlong came in as a reporting victim.

00:35:36.280 --> 00:35:38.040 line:100%
We have no direct evidence

00:35:38.120 --> 00:35:39.280 line:100%
and no detention warrant.

00:35:39.360 --> 00:35:41.520 line:100%
If he keeps making a scene,

00:35:41.600 --> 00:35:43.000 line:100%
we'll only end up more passive.

00:35:43.080 --> 00:35:44.960 line:100%
Wait here. I'll go back
to the bureau and get one issued.

00:35:45.040 --> 00:35:46.200 line:100%
Hold on.

00:35:47.040 --> 00:35:48.080 line:100%
Let him go first.

00:35:48.160 --> 00:35:49.600 line:100%
See what he does.

00:35:49.680 --> 00:35:52.160 line:100%
If there really are accomplices
or anything hidden,

00:35:52.240 --> 00:35:54.280 line:100%
once he's out, he'll make a move.

00:35:57.520 --> 00:35:58.720 line:100%
I'm just angry.

00:35:59.240 --> 00:36:01.160 line:100%
This guy has played us so many times,

00:36:01.240 --> 00:36:04.480 line:100%
and now he's still out there living it up,

00:36:04.560 --> 00:36:06.280 line:100%
free for five whole years.

00:36:07.760 --> 00:36:09.560 line:100%
That's exactly why those
five years have cost us so much.

00:36:09.640 --> 00:36:11.120 line:100%
Many clues and evidence

00:36:11.200 --> 00:36:12.640 line:100%
are now hard to track down.

00:36:12.720 --> 00:36:15.000 line:100%
We might as well let him show his hand,

00:36:15.080 --> 00:36:16.560 line:100%
then use that chance to break through.

00:36:17.160 --> 00:36:19.200 line:100%
Don't worry. I'll keep an eye on him.

00:36:20.400 --> 00:36:21.440 line:100%
Then we cover both ends.

00:36:21.520 --> 00:36:22.880 line:100%
I'll go find Jin Manshan

00:36:22.960 --> 00:36:24.840 line:100%
and see if I can get anything out of him.

00:36:26.320 --> 00:36:28.520 line:100%
Jin Manshan got involved
in organized crime three years ago

00:36:28.600 --> 00:36:29.640 line:100%
and fled.

00:36:31.360 --> 00:36:32.880 line:100%
The big one may run,

00:36:32.960 --> 00:36:33.920 line:100%
but the small one won't.

00:36:39.640 --> 00:36:42.400 line:100%
PUBLIC SECURITY

00:37:02.840 --> 00:37:04.080 line:100%
Let's go to Yuanlongli.

00:37:26.320 --> 00:37:30.200 line:100%
SWISH!

00:37:31.360 --> 00:37:32.840 line:100%
BANG!

00:37:38.280 --> 00:37:39.440 line:20%
Take a break.

00:37:39.960 --> 00:37:41.480 line:100%
Eat while it's hot.

00:37:43.440 --> 00:37:44.400 line:100%
I'll eat later.

00:37:44.480 --> 00:37:46.000 line:100%
What do you mean later?

00:37:46.080 --> 00:37:48.480 line:100%
By the time you remember,
I'll have cooked the next meal.

00:37:48.560 --> 00:37:49.560 line:100%
I'm watching you.

00:37:49.640 --> 00:37:50.960 line:100%
Eat it now.

00:38:00.840 --> 00:38:01.880 line:100%
By the way,

00:38:02.400 --> 00:38:04.120 line:100%
did that kid say anything today?

00:38:07.320 --> 00:38:08.560 line:100%
He's developed acute stress.

00:38:08.640 --> 00:38:10.120 line:100%
He hasn't said a word,

00:38:10.200 --> 00:38:11.520 line:100%
completely shut himself off.

00:38:13.680 --> 00:38:14.600 line:20%
Right now,

00:38:14.680 --> 00:38:17.160 line:20%
I'm reading the comics he used to read,
trying to find a breakthrough.

00:38:18.040 --> 00:38:20.600 line:100%
His mother said he usually just reads,

00:38:20.680 --> 00:38:21.880 line:100%
doesn't play games or hang out online.

00:38:21.960 --> 00:38:23.720 line:100%
I just can't figure out

00:38:23.800 --> 00:38:26.320 line:100%
why he skipped school
and went to Yuanlongli.

00:38:26.400 --> 00:38:28.200 line:100%
Times change.

00:38:28.280 --> 00:38:29.640 line:100%
Energy is limited.

00:38:30.160 --> 00:38:31.840 line:100%
Focus on the important.
Let go of the trivial.

00:38:31.920 --> 00:38:33.680 line:100%
Food and clothing come first.

00:38:34.720 --> 00:38:35.720 line:100%
What does that mean?

00:38:35.800 --> 00:38:38.480 line:100%
It means when you investigate,

00:38:38.560 --> 00:38:40.200 line:100%
you have to rely on common sense.

00:38:40.280 --> 00:38:42.440 line:100%
What Han Zi'ang's mother said

00:38:42.520 --> 00:38:44.480 line:100%
can't be taken at face value.

00:38:44.560 --> 00:38:46.800 line:100%
That doesn't mean
she's lying to the police,

00:38:47.440 --> 00:38:49.960 line:100%
but how many parents nowadays

00:38:50.040 --> 00:38:52.440 line:100%
truly understand their children?

00:38:53.040 --> 00:38:55.440 line:100%
Especially teenagers.

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:57.640 line:100%
Just like back then,

00:38:57.720 --> 00:38:58.840 line:100%
you didn't understand me either.

00:39:00.280 --> 00:39:01.400 line:100%
So,

00:39:01.480 --> 00:39:05.680 line:100%
what Han Zi'ang's mother sees
may just be the side

00:39:05.760 --> 00:39:08.480 line:100%
he wants her to see.

00:39:08.560 --> 00:39:10.680 line:100%
Maybe Han Zi'ang

00:39:10.760 --> 00:39:13.080 line:100%
does like gaming and hanging out online.

00:39:15.360 --> 00:39:16.200 line:100%
That makes sense.

00:39:16.280 --> 00:39:18.320 line:100%
At his age,

00:39:18.400 --> 00:39:19.960 line:100%
legal internet cafes won't admit him.

00:39:20.040 --> 00:39:21.240 line:100%
He can only go to unlicensed ones.

00:39:22.040 --> 00:39:25.040 line:100%
But there aren't any in Yuanlongli.

00:39:25.120 --> 00:39:27.080 line:100%
If you can find them,

00:39:28.080 --> 00:39:29.920 line:100%
they wouldn't be unlicensed, would they?

00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:36.440 line:100%
LASER ENGRAVING. CUSTOM GIFTS

00:39:46.120 --> 00:39:50.160 line:100%
JUAN JUAN SHOE SHOP

00:39:50.240 --> 00:39:51.920 line:100%
LIANG'S COMPUTER SUPPLIES

00:39:52.000 --> 00:39:52.840 line:100%
Miss.

00:39:53.440 --> 00:39:54.520 line:100%
Where's your boss?

00:39:55.440 --> 00:39:57.320 line:100%
He stepped out.

00:39:57.400 --> 00:39:59.880 line:100%
I've already asked this shop before.
No useful leads.

00:39:59.960 --> 00:40:01.040 line:100%
Let's hurry and check the internet cafes.

00:40:06.760 --> 00:40:08.560 line:100%
-Dad.
-Sir.

00:40:24.040 --> 00:40:25.440 line:100%
Heal him.

00:40:27.280 --> 00:40:29.200 line:100%
Druid, you can't heal?

00:40:31.240 --> 00:40:33.480 line:100%
Uncle He, you scared me.

00:40:33.560 --> 00:40:35.440 line:100%
At least say something first.

00:40:35.520 --> 00:40:36.600 line:100%
You're the owner here, right?

00:40:38.440 --> 00:40:39.920 line:100%
Why are you running
an illegal internet cafe

00:40:40.000 --> 00:40:41.400 line:100%
and letting minors play games?

00:40:42.000 --> 00:40:43.320 line:100%
Officer?

00:40:43.400 --> 00:40:44.440 line:100%
Officer, you've misunderstood.

00:40:44.520 --> 00:40:45.640 line:100%
I'm not running an illegal place.

00:40:45.720 --> 00:40:46.960 line:100%
I have a license. A license?

00:40:47.040 --> 00:40:50.080 line:100%
I just can't stand seeing kids
having nowhere to play.

00:40:50.160 --> 00:40:51.200 line:100%
That's why I let them in.

00:40:51.280 --> 00:40:53.000 line:100%
What I'm doing
is basically a public service.

00:40:53.080 --> 00:40:54.040 line:100%
I don't charge anything.

00:40:54.120 --> 00:40:56.640 line:100%
Really. I can swear on my game logs.

00:40:59.920 --> 00:41:02.240 line:100%
Alright, don't make things hard for Du.

00:41:02.320 --> 00:41:05.400 line:100%
He's an old acquaintance
of both me and your Uncle Ran.

00:41:05.480 --> 00:41:06.360 line:100%
Really.

00:41:10.400 --> 00:41:11.320 line:100%
Let me ask you again.

00:41:11.400 --> 00:41:12.800 line:100%
Have you seen this kid?

00:41:15.200 --> 00:41:17.120 line:100%
I already told you earlier,

00:41:17.200 --> 00:41:18.400 line:100%
I haven't seen him.

00:41:19.880 --> 00:41:21.680 line:100%
You can go ask outside.

00:41:26.440 --> 00:41:28.320 line:100%
-Uncle He, your daughter
-Hey, boy.

00:41:28.400 --> 00:41:29.640 line:100%
-is fierce.
-Excuse me.

00:41:29.720 --> 00:41:30.800 line:100%
Have you seen this kid before?

00:41:30.880 --> 00:41:32.480 line:100%
Takes after her dad.

00:41:32.560 --> 00:41:34.440 line:100%
Born to be a criminal investigator.

00:41:35.040 --> 00:41:36.160 line:100%
That's right.

00:41:36.240 --> 00:41:38.400 line:100%
Hey, excuse me.

00:41:38.480 --> 00:41:39.600 line:100%
Have you seen this kid?

00:41:39.680 --> 00:41:40.880 line:100%
No.

00:41:42.160 --> 00:41:44.120 line:100%
Hi. Have you seen this kid?

00:41:44.720 --> 00:41:45.760 line:100%
No.

00:41:47.680 --> 00:41:48.800 line:100%
Wait.

00:41:51.000 --> 00:41:52.480 line:100%
I've seen him.

00:41:52.560 --> 00:41:55.760 line:100%
Last week, he was at that computer
watching role playing stuff,

00:41:55.840 --> 00:41:56.960 line:100%
laughing while watching,

00:41:57.040 --> 00:41:58.840 line:100%
even speaking some Japanese.

00:41:58.920 --> 00:42:01.000 line:100%
Definitely a hardcore anime fan.

00:42:01.640 --> 00:42:03.240 line:100%
Pull up photos of those four kids.

00:42:04.120 --> 00:42:05.720 line:100%
Excuse me. Can I use your computer?

00:42:13.280 --> 00:42:15.320 line:100%
These four, have you seen them?

00:42:16.600 --> 00:42:17.440 line:100%
Haven't seen them.

00:42:17.520 --> 00:42:18.880 line:100%
What about you? Have you seen them?

00:42:23.200 --> 00:42:24.120 line:100%
This one, I've seen.

00:42:24.200 --> 00:42:25.360 line:100%
SPREAD THE NEWS: THESE KIDS ARE MISSING

00:42:25.440 --> 00:42:26.920 line:100%
This one, I've seen too.